# DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Sequence Transformation
# Difficulty: Advanced
# Concept: Sequence Iteration & Series Transformation
# Mode: Scholar (Latin transliteration)
#
# Purpose:
#   Demonstrates iterating across sequence entries with bounded loops to compute
#   cumulative sums and transformed series.
#
# Expected Output:
#   120
#   4
#   96

problem
    working raw_values of length 0
    append 12 to raw_values
    append 24 to raw_values
    append 36 to raw_values
    append 48 to raw_values

    working doubled of length 0
    total : 0

    consider entries of raw_values:
        append v * 2 to doubled
        total : total + v

    doubled_len : length of doubled
    final_entry : last from doubled

result
    total
    doubled_len
    final_entry
